{"name":"Mog battle","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":138,"casual":{"lead":["In looksmaxxing slang, to 'mog' someone is to outclass them in appearance. A mog battle is a thread that puts two photos side by side, from friends, rivals or the poster himself, and asks the community who wins.","Threads on looksmax.org carry titles like 'mog battle between my friends' or 'mog battle who mogs', and replies are short verdicts, sometimes with feature-level commentary."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["A poster uploads two photos and asks 'who mogs'. Respondents answer with a pick and often cite features such as facial structure."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["The format invites blunt, sometimes insulting responses. Opinions vary between voters and depend on photo quality and angle."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1834949/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260223203317/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1834949/"},{"title":"mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1777765/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260114015927/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1777765/"},{"title":"mog battle between my friends","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-between-my-friends.1770824/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229082507/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-between-my-friends.1770824/"},{"title":"mog battle who mogs","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-who-mogs.1761423/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251220182331/https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-who-mogs.1761423/"},{"title":"mog battle between the 3 slayers of the forum","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-between-the-3-slayers-of-the-forum.1744070/","site":"looksmax.org