g battle is a comparison thread on looksmax.org in which a poster shows two people's photos and the community votes on which one 'mogs' (outclasses) the other [1][2][3].","Threads range from friends and forum members to subscription-service matchups, and carry titles such as 'mog battle who mogs' and 'mog battle me vs...' [4][5]. Replies usually name a winner and sometimes comment on specific features, for example a poster pointing to the sphenoid area as the reason one face looked a certain way [3].","For users, the threads give a quick read on how a face compares and which features stand out."],"infobox":[["Type","Forum thread format"],["Platform","looksmax.org"],["Related terms","Mogging, rating threads"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["The format asks voters to pick the better-looking of two people. Replies are brief and informal, for example a one-line choice of 'the second one' [2], and some focus on bone structure features [3]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["Mog battles are one of several comparison and rating formats on the forum, alongside appearance-rating threads. Many thread titles (for example those pairing a user with another member or a named rival) show the format used for social competition as well as feedback [5][6]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1834949/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mog battle","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle.1777765/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mog battle between my friends","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-between-my-friends.1770824/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mog battle who mogs","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mog-battle-who-mogs.1761423/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"mog battl